      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠴᠥᠮᠥᠷᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>čömürekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>цөмрөх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>CØMYRE-</transcript>
      <definition>[=cømyr-, cømyri--] ,v.i. To fall in, break down or through; to crumble; to crack, dent, develop holes; to collapse, fall down; to break into, commit burglary.</definition>
      <page>203</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠥᠮᠥᠷᠠᠨ ᠣᠷᠤᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n oruxu</transcript>
          <definition> To break in.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠥᠮᠥᠷᠠᠨ ᠬᠠᠯᠳᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n xaldaxu</transcript>
          <definition> To attack, invade, raid,</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
